<Section folder="Camping" xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xsi:noNamespaceSchemaLocation="../section.xsd">
	<Name>Camping</Name>
	<Summary xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xsi:noNamespaceSchemaLocation="../summary.xsd">
		<p>
			The VanOrmans <span class="SUPER_EMPHASIZE">love</span> to go camping. So cooking outdoors is one of our things.
			<br />
			<span class="NOTE">(Di <u>doesn't</u> like the camping, but she does like the outdoor cooking since she gets to sit back for a change.)</span>
		</p>
		<p>
			We especially <span class="SUPER_DUPER_EMPHASIZE">love</span> to do Dutch Oven cooking!
			<br />
			When Ransom was a 11-year-old Boy Scout, he was introduced to Dutch Oven cooking by his Dad.
			<span class="NOTE">(Grandpa John was his Scoutmaster.)</span>
			And we have been doing it ever since.
			<br />
			In in all that time, we have gathered several award-winning recipes, and have made up several recipes of our own.
		</p>
	</Summary>
